args.description:
JSON-encoded string, stored without validation, in the A/B test `editorPatch` format of the
`ab-test-variant-patches` skill: a `default` array of one-change transforms plus optional `style` and `script`.
Example: {"default":[{"target":"h1","text":"New headline","finalSelectors":["h1"]}]}

JSON-encoded object with `checks`, `voices`, `voiceTestContent`, and `profile` (`context`, `audience`), shaped
like `pageEditorGetBrandGuidelines` output; entries reusing a built-in `id` read back as the default. Example:
{"checks":[],"voices":[],"profile":{"context":"","audience":""}}

