fields.description:
Returns occurrences for one fingerprint and required window, with recording permissions. Pagination starts at
page 1 and follows `order`, defaulting to newest creation time. Use `uniqueErrorList` for grouped fingerprints;
an empty page returns an empty list. Requires errors view access.
